import pf.Html

## The front page: a welcome, and where to start. Replace it with your app's own.
meta = { title: "Home" }

view! = |_|
	<>
		<section class="hello">
			<h1>Your app is running</h1>
			<p class="lead">Signing in, sessions, mail and security headers are set up. Here is where to start.</p>
		</section>
		<ol class="steps">
			<li>
				<h2>This page</h2>
				<p>It is <code>routes/+page.rocx</code>. Change it and save: <code>rocx dev</code> builds again and reloads the page.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<h2>Sign in</h2>
				<p>At <a href="/sign-in">/sign-in</a>, by a mailed link. Under <code>rocx dev</code> the mail lands in the dev mailbox, <a href="/__rocx/mail">/__rocx/mail</a>, and any address can sign in at once.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<h2>A page for signed-in people</h2>
				<p><a href="/account">Your account</a> is <code>routes/account/</code>: the page in <code>+page.rocx</code>, and what it reads and posts in <code>+server.roc</code>, whose <code>middleware</code> lets only signed-in people through.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<h2>Your data</h2>
				<p>Add a table in <code>migrations/</code> (the next file is <code>0002_….sql</code>), then read and write it with <code>Db.all!</code> and <code>Db.run!</code> in a route's <code>+server.roc</code>.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<p class="more">README.md says the rest: mail, the database, going live. The guide is at <a href="https://roc-solid.github.io/">roc-solid.github.io</a>.</p>
	</>

<style>
	.hello {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.lead {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.steps {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		counter-reset: step;
	}

	.steps li {
		position: relative;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1rem 3.5rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: calc(var(--radius) + 4px);
		background: var(--surface);
		counter-increment: step;
	}

	.steps li::before {
		content: counter(step);
		position: absolute;
		left: 1.1rem;
		top: 1rem;
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		width: 1.6rem;
		height: 1.6rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--accent-soft);
		color: var(--accent);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.steps p {
		margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
	}

	.more {
		margin: 2rem 0 0;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
	}
</style>
